{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/裁决·一骑当先","pageid":6030,"revid":13995,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%C2%B7%E4%B8%80%E9%AA%91%E5%BD%93%E5%85%88&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%C2%B7%E4%B8%80%E9%AA%91%E5%BD%93%E5%85%88&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%C2%B7%E4%B8%80%E9%AA%91%E5%BD%93%E5%85%88&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>裁决·一骑当先</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.A3.81.E5.86.B3.C2.B7.E4.B8.80.E9.AA.91.E5.BD.93.E5.85.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"裁决·一骑当先\"><b>裁决·一骑当先</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 裁决一骑当先.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a1/fdpq3yzi8q7elutsi1ip63svld3ergy.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%80%E9%AA%91%E5%BD%93%E5%85%88.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a1/fdpq3yzi8q7elutsi1ip63svld3ergy.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E4%B8%80%E9%AA%91%E5%BD%93%E5%85%88.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a1/fdpq3yzi8q7elutsi1ip63svld3ergy.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />裁决·一骑当先\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3*3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，跳跃至目标地点，对目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>圈内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>范围伤害，再施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×反应技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×反应技</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。攻击后，技能变更为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">裁决·千军溃灭</font></span>]，技能保留<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 3*3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8e/igmhi7o3tcz8550r5o452hts3q2oa32.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_3%2A3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"83\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8e/igmhi7o3tcz8550r5o452hts3q2oa32.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_3%2A3.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8e/igmhi7o3tcz8550r5o452hts3q2oa32.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_3%2A3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"181\" data-file-height=\"187\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8D%A1%E5%A7%86%E6%B4%9B%E7%89%B9\" title=\"角色图鉴库/卡姆洛特\"><img alt=\"头像 卡姆洛特.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7a/055d058w92ojnx9czcfbv2ddszpscvu.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">卡姆洛特</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p